   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_08"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm good, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.52,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I keep saying I'll play one round and then study, and then it's two in the morning.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.54,
   "block": "video_games.dlg22",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's very human. Games are designed to make one more round feel tempting. Do you want some tricks to break the loop?",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Never mind Moshi, the new speaker sounds amazing.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "block": "mm_123",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "moshi_mention",
   "phrasing": "mm_123",
   "name_pos": "none"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Please. My exams are in three weeks.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 3.15,
   "block": "video_games.dlg22",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Flip it around. Study first, and use a game session as the reward. Set a timer on your phone and stop when it goes off, even mid match.",
   "est_sec": 8.78,
   "gap_before": 1.21,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Mid match is",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "video_games.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "brutal though.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 2.41,
   "block": "video_games.dlg22",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then pick games without long matches during exam season. Or play only on certain evenings, so you're not deciding every night.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 1.63,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg22"
  },
  {
